# Git & PRs

- Base branch: `master`.
- Branch naming: `cursor/<descriptive-slug>-d10c` (Cloud) or `agent/<scope>-<slug>` (local).
- One concern per PR. Prefer draft PRs from agents; humans merge.
- Do not commit secrets, GA4 credential JSON, or `.cursor/mcp.json`.
